OL,3,GNEWSADispersal order and drones for
OL,4,Afootball derby
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers said they will be using extra
OL,7,Fpowers, drones and its mounted unit to
OL,8,Fpolice the "eagerly-anticipated" Black
OL,9,FCountry derby on Sunday.
OL,11,FWolverhampton Wanderers meet West
OL,12,FBromwich Albion for their first league
OL,13,Fmeeting in five years. The early
OL,14,Fkick-off at Molineux starts at midday.
OL,16,FWest Midlands Police said it has worked
OL,17,Fwith partners "over many months" to
OL,18,Fprepare and ensure people can savour
OL,19,Fthe day safely.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
