OL,3,GNEWSADispersal order and drones for
OL,4,Afootball derby
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a crackdown on any antisocial
OL,7,Fbehaviour, harassment and and crime,
OL,8,Fdispersal order powers will be in place
OL,9,Fin Wolverhampton city centre and the
OL,10,Fwider area for 24 hours from 08:00 BST,
OL,11,Fthe force said.
